      },
      "quality": "B",
      "fact_status": "verified",
      "lifecycle": "active",
      "priority": 3,
      "template_id": "technical-qa",
      "fields": {
        "问题": "在 vLLM d7ada3a 的正常成功 NIXL PULL 中，监控先看到 P 的 finished_sending，稍后才看到 D 的 finished_recving。应怎样判断这是不是提前释放，而不只比较时间戳？",
        "答案": {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "lead",
              "parts": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
